+To spread retries as widely as possible, use "full jitter", which returns a
+random value between 0 and the result (see the AWS article on [exponential
+backoff and jitter][aws-jitter]).
+
+```golang
+b := NewFibonacci(1 * time.Second)
+
+// Return a random value in [0, next)
+b = WithFullJitter(b)
+```
+
+[aws-jitter]: https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/architecture/exponential-backoff-and-jitter/
+
